      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `6d212ba2bc4b98f93215325a16a1353fb621ecfeb7ab40d80a2f4e40bf5f22a4--recorded-crime-offenders-2010-11-cube-8-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | d9a7a60fd96f7ec73b7ccef510e3b497b9d484c9b8aaa6f2233dff11ffcf3598 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 6608ea121a1c714d026753441e697eeae0717d28a47ef02f9b46956698a95922 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | e68ee2e291843fe84117cfcc5d97c7309db98e88837fbcee8f953ff5054ced98 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | e4338907a92b9517255580bc81ba2940bdaae561847b0df87601f5ce63382845 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | b08ae2d96fc7bb788ad25e7e1fa5f3c5f0694949c5f6020cd9b7ef15fb2c1908 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | daf84f633e525a30e6ecf53de88a9b4ffa5b67dbf5208496397660798622cba9 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 844b33e9e0199196df4d7d526c2dd7d67b28ac4d58d3147c4c10e9ea33b10db7 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
